21700 The unchanged Conduit application compared in four platform/build combinations per paired page case. Measured 19,699-19,702M x86-64 Linux reference instructions on 2026-10-15 (PR #98); this grant adds 10%. The owner re-granted it on 2026-10-15, replacing the 15,300M grant of 2026-10-14, which was sized from CPU time on a host without an instruction counter. Remove when the application builds fit the global budget.
